 "findings": [
  "Under the provisional 10 kb polymer mapping (needs_review), D = 0.5 reduced is 0.0054 um^2/s and the schema maximum of 5 is 0.054 um^2/s. Free nuclear transcription factors are typically reported at roughly 1-10 um^2/s by single-molecule tracking (order of magnitude; not re-verified in this study), so protein mobility in the coarse presets is not on the polymer clock and must be calibrated separately."
